To start Colony as an MCP stdio server, configure your agent with:

```json
{
  "mcpServers": {
    "colony": {
      "command": "colony",
      "args": ["--home", "/absolute/path/to/agent-home", "mcp"]
    }
  }
}
```

Use an absolute executable path if `colony` isn’t on `PATH`. The MCP server provides `ask` and `push` tools. ([README.md](README.md))
